<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>브랜드 소개 | YH04</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;700;900&family=Permanent+Marker&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        .uni-special-font {
            font-family: 'Permanent Marker', cursive;
            display: inline-block;
            transform: skewX(-10deg);
            margin-right: -1.2vw;
            font-weight: 400 !important;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            font-size: 1.15em;
        }
        .versity-text {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            color: #fff;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="dark-mode">
    <div class="custom-cursor" id="cursor"></div>
    
    <header id="header" class="scrolled">
        <nav>
            <div class="logo-norris hoverable" onclick="location.href='index.html'">
                HWANG<br>YOUNGHO
            </div>
            
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="index.html" class="hoverable">HOME</a></li>
                <li class="nav-item-dropdown">
                    <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="hoverable active">브랜드 소개</a>
                    <ul class="dropdown-menu">
                        <li><a href="about.html" class="hoverable active">소개</a></li>
                        <li><a href="news.html" class="hoverable">소식</a></li>
                        <li><a href="partnership.html" class="hoverable">다가오는 파트너십</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item-dropdown">
                    <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="hoverable">제품 소식</a>
                    <ul class="dropdown-menu">
                        <li><a href="series.html" class="hoverable">시리즈별 세트</a></li>
                        <li><a href="age.html" class="hoverable">연령별</a></li>
                        <li><a href="price.html" class="hoverable">가격별</a></li>
                        <li><a href="new.html" class="hoverable">신제품</a></li>
                        <li><a href="exclusive.html" class="hoverable">독점 제품</a></li>
                        <li><a href="deals.html" class="hoverable">할인 및 행사</a></li>
                        <li><a href="coming-soon.html" class="hoverable">출시 예정</a></li>
                        <li><a href="last-chance.html" class="hoverable">단종 예정</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li><a href="companies.html" class="hoverable">장바구니</a></li>
                <li class="nav-item-dropdown">
                    <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="hoverable">고객 지원</a>
                    <ul class="dropdown-menu">
                        <li><a href="order.html" class="hoverable">주문 현황 확인</a></li>
                        <li><a href="shipping.html" class="hoverable">배송 및 반품</a></li>
                        <li><a href="assembly.html" class="hoverable">조립 설명서 검색</a></li>
                        <li><a href="faq.html" class="hoverable">일반적인 질문</a></li>
                        <li><a href="contact.html" class="hoverable">문의하기</a></li>
                        <li><a href="bricks.html" class="hoverable">부속품 및 브릭</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
            </ul>

            <div class="header-right">
                <button class="login-btn hoverable" id="open-login">로그인</button>
                <button class="burger-menu hoverable">
                    <span></span>
                    <span></span>
                    <span></span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="on-track-hero section" style="padding-top: 150px; min-height: 100vh; background-color: #0b0b0b; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
            <div class="section-container" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 60px;">
                <h1 style="font-size: 12vw; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 900; line-height: 0.8; margin: 0; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -0.5vw;">
                    <span class="uni-special-font" style="color: var(--accent-color);">ABOUT</span><br><span class="versity-text">BRAND</span>
                </h1>
            </div>
            
            <div class="hero-content-wrapper" style="max-width: 1000px; padding: 0 40px; text-align: center;">
                <p style="font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem); line-height: 1.1; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 50px;">
                    우리는 한계를 넘어 혁신적인 솔루션을 추구하며,<br>모든 프로젝트에 <span class="uni-special-font" style="color: var(--accent-color);">열정을 쏟습니다.</span>
                </p>
                
                <div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding: 50px; border-radius: 30px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
                    <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; opacity: 0.7; line-height: 1.8;">
                        YH04는 단순한 브랜드를 넘어 기술과 예술의 경계를 허무는 여정을 이어가고 있습니다.<br>
                        2021년 서울에서 시작된 이 여정은 이제 글로벌 무대를 향해 나아가고 있습니다.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <!-- Login/Signup Modals (Omitted for brevity in this response, but will be included in full file) -->
    <div class="modal-overlay" id="login-modal">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <button class="modal-close" id="close-login">&times;</button>
            <h2 class="modal-title">로그인</h2>
            <form class="modal-form">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="email">이메일</label>
                    <input type="email" id="email" placeholder="이메일을 입력하세요" required>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="password">비밀번호</label>
                    <input type="password" id="password" placeholder="비밀번호를 입력하세요" required>
                </div>
                <button type="submit" class="modal-submit">로그인</button>
            </form>
            <div class="social-login">
                <p class="social-divider">다른 계정으로 계속</p>
                <div class="social-icons">
                    <a href="https://www.facebook.com/login" target="_blank" class="social-icon facebook hoverable" title="Facebook으로 로그인"><i class="fab fa-facebook-f"></i></a>
                    <a href="https://accounts.google.com/signin" target="_blank" class="social-icon google hoverable" title="Google로 로그인"><i class="fab fa-google"></i></a>
                    <a href="https://appleid.apple.com/" target="_blank" class="social-icon apple hoverable" title="Apple로 로그인"><i class="fab fa-apple"></i></a>
                    <a href="https://v3.account.samsung.com/" target="_blank" class="social-icon samsung hoverable" title="Samsung으로 로그인"><i class="fa-solid fa-s"></i></a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer">
                계정이 없으신가요? <span class="modal-link" id="go-to-signup">회원가입</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="modal-overlay" id="signup-modal">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <button class="modal-close" id="close-signup">&times;</button>
            <h2 class="modal-title">회원가입</h2>
            <form class="modal-form">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="new-name">이름</label>
                    <input type="text" id="new-name" placeholder="이름을 입력하세요" required>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="new-email">이메일</label>
                    <input type="email" id="new-email" placeholder="이메일을 입력하세요" required>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="new-password">비밀번호</label>
                    <input type="password" id="new-password" placeholder="비밀번호를 입력하세요" required>
                </div>
                <button type="submit" class="modal-submit">회원가입</button>
            </form>
            <div class="modal-footer">
                이미 계정이 있으신가요? <span class="modal-link" id="go-to-login">로그인</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
